sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as API
  participant Policy as Tenant and policy
  participant Job as Durable job store
  participant Worker
  participant Adapter as cPanel adapter
  participant Host as cPanel UAPI
  User->>UI: Request inventory refresh
  UI->>API: POST refresh (idempotency key)
  API->>Policy: Check tenant and read permission
  Policy-->>API: Allow or deny with reason
  API->>Job: Persist refresh job and audit event
  API-->>UI: Job ID and queued state
  Worker->>Job: Claim pending job
  Worker->>Policy: Re-check tenant/action policy
  Worker->>Adapter: Fetch read-only inventory
  Adapter->>Host: UAPI request with TLS and scoped credentials
  Host-->>Adapter: Response or provider error
  Adapter-->>Worker: Normalized rows plus provenance
  Worker->>Job: Persist result, timestamps, and outcome
  UI->>API: Poll job and inventory state
  API-->>UI: Status, freshness, counts, and safe error
